.SH DESCRIPTION

The
.B auto-cups-setup
command installs essential packages plus some common printer drivers,
and enables the CUPS printing service.

Note: CUPS will not support drivers in the future, so the driver
installations here are allowed to fail.

.SH RETURN VALUES

0 on success, non-zero error codes otherwise.

